Z||000000||ole_man||12-06-2001||11:57 AM||||Does anyone know if the 1.8 Turbo Pontiac engine from an 86' Sunbird will bolt up to the 4-speed trans in an 84' Fiero. I had a sunbird with this engine and was impressed with it's performance.||||reg||5
